# Stage 7a: retrieval baselines and follow-up bank

66 unique texts, 20 families, leave-one-family-out, k=5. Classes: 5 care types + ask_followup. With this little data treat differences of a few points as noise.

## Retrieval kNN routing

### dry-run-hash  (0.0s)

| method | macro_f1 | accuracy | emergency_recall | emergency_fn | over_triage |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| bm25 | 0.326 | 0.348 | 0.333 | 6 | 1 |
| dense | 0.379 | 0.379 | 0.111 | 8 | 3 |
| hybrid | 0.29 | 0.333 | 0.444 | 5 | 2 |

